**4. Project Timeline**

The project is divided into five main phases, each with specific activities and milestones.

| Phase | Description | Start Date | End Date | Milestones |
|-------|-------------|------------|----------|------------|
| Phase 1 | Site Preparation | Jan 2023 | Mar 2023 | Site cleared, utilities relocated |
| Phase 2 | Foundation Work | Apr 2023 | Jun 2023 | Foundation poured, slab inspection passed |
| Phase 3 | Structural Framework | Jul 2023 | Nov 2023 | Steel framework erected, framing inspection completed |
| Phase 4 | Interior and Exterior Finishing | Dec 2023 | Aug 2024 | Drywall installed, roofing completed |
| Phase 5 | Final Inspections and Handover | Sep 2024 | Dec 2024 | Occupancy permit received, project completed |

**Phase 1: Site Preparation**

Activities include clearing the site, relocating utilities, and setting up temporary facilities for workers.

**Phase 2: Foundation Work**

This phase involves digging, pouring concrete, and ensuring proper drainage systems are in place.

**Phase 3: Structural Framework**

The structural framework includes erecting steel beams and columns, followed by inspections to ensure compliance with structural integrity standards.

**Phase 4: Interior and Exterior Finishing**

This phase encompasses all finishes, including drywall installation, roofing, and exterior landscaping.

**Phase 5: Final Inspections and Handover**

Final inspections are conducted by local authorities, and upon passing, the occupancy permit is issued to allow businesses to move in.

